<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Abdullah II of Jordan</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1962">1962</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Abdullah II of Jordan has been king since 1999, succeeding his father Hussein. Trained as a soldier, he has kept the Hashemite monarchy stable through regional wars and the Arab Spring, while Jordan has taken in large numbers of Iraqi and Syrian refugees. His reign has seen limited political reform and close ties with Western states.</p></div>
